# Canonical components

Search these before building anything new. Reference implementations live in
`design-system/` (product-ready) and `design-lab/` (visual reference to port).

| Component | Role | Reference |
|---|---|---|
| `PlayUpMark` | Monogram, all sizes | `design-system/PlayUpMark.tsx` |
| `PlayUpWordmark` | Brand name + arrow in chrome | `design-system/PlayUpWordmark.tsx` |
| `TrendIcon` | Slanted up/down/flat arrows | `design-system/TrendIcon.tsx` |
| `LiveStatus` | Pulse dot + live label | `design-system/components/LiveStatus.tsx` |
| `PanelHead` | Panel title + optional neutral icon + right meta | `design-system/components/PanelHead.tsx` |
| `MatchRow` | One match, state-driven (score / time / pill / live) | `design-system/components/MatchRow.tsx` |
| Match Hero | Match object header, 3 states (scheduled/live/finished) | `design-system/components/MatchHero.tsx` |
| `Crest` | Team initials block | `design-lab/LabShared.tsx` |
| Status pill | `ds-status` tones (success/attention/error/info/neutral/live) | design system CSS |
| Buttons | `ds-btn--primary/secondary/ghost` — one primary per surface | design system CSS |
| Dialog / Drawer | Overlay level | existing shell components |
| Shell rail / header | Dark rail + light competition header | `foundations/shell.css`, `shell/` |
| Attention row | Count + icon + label + action (D9 recipe) | `design-system/components/AttentionRow.tsx` |
| Cycle line | Lifecycle progress (Préparation → … → Terminée) | `design-system/components/CycleLine.tsx` |
| Cockpit situation | Hero number + label + cycle | `design-system/components/CockpitSituation.tsx` |
| Cockpit next action | Prochaine action panel | `design-system/components/CockpitNextAction.tsx` |
| Cockpit podium | Terminée Top-3 blocks | `design-system/components/CockpitPodium.tsx` |
| Standings table | Full grid + zones + trends | `foundations/standings.css`, `StandingsLegend.tsx` |
| Match round | Journée section in calendar | `design-system/components/MatchRound.tsx` |
| Match round status | Journée state pill / live | `design-system/components/MatchRoundStatus.tsx` |
| Home brand | Accueil mark + wordmark | `design-system/components/HomeBrand.tsx` |

## Rules

- A new component must have a **visual or behavioral reason to exist** —
  technical reusability alone does not justify one.
- Never re-style a canonical component locally (no inline overrides of
  scores, pills, buttons).
- State-driven rendering: normal state implicit, notable states explicit
  (MatchRow is the model).
